# The local data space: the operational SQLite database and the evaluation
# datasets frozen from it (Phase 10.1, data/evaluation/datasets/<dataset_id>/).
# Those datasets hold real opportunities, real URLs and one real person's
# eligibility decisions, so the whole directory stays out of Git.
data/

